{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達圍繞行政總裁黃仁勳與一名涉嫌受中國國家安全部招募的商界女性之間的關係，正式啓動獨立調查。<strong>英偉達董事會11月8日宣佈，將由獨立董事組成專門委員會，並聘請外部獨立律師參與調查，以核實近期媒體披露的外國情報活動指控。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585518.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.534626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T20:47:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"e21ca43284b9259c8bf9d491bb34f9ed9cdd0f457eeb5a31f3743d24a34d11a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}